# Send and generate

- Send only `APPROVED` drafts. Create `EmailSend`, set draft `SENT`, set contact `CONTACTED`, write an EMAIL activity.
- Read pacing from `AppSettings` (`delayBetweenEmailsSeconds`, `maxEmailsPerDay`). Keep the daily cap check before sending.
- One Resend call per recipient. Default from: `Alex <alex@experidium.online>`.
- Generate uses Groq (`GROQ_API_KEY`), not Gemini. Throttle ~2100ms. Output must parse `Subject:` / `Body:`.
- Webhook route must keep optional `RESEND_WEBHOOK_SECRET` verification and event-hash dedupe.
- Never log API keys or full recipient payloads to the client.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — send every draftId with no status filter or delay
// ✅ GOOD — APPROVED only, then sleep using AppSettings delay
```
